{"3491350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seeker Tactics", "steam_appid": 3491350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sacred retreat was attacked by monsters, leaving no survivors. The Seeker organization, known for its miraculous feats, has been commissioned by local officials to uncover the truth behind the incident before the situation spirals out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491350/extras/72669b81a0739705676019d3bf059969.avif?t=1765121104\" width=1024 height=308 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee the seeker base to retrieve powerful artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist the locals with their requests to uncover the secrets of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip seekers with powerful abilities and summonable monsters to survive the ruthless battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High risk, high reward. A smart move brings great gains, but a foolish choice? Say goodbye to all your loot!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sacred retreat was attacked by monsters, leaving no survivors. The Seeker organization, known for its miraculous feats, has been commissioned by local officials to uncover the truth behind the incident before the situation spirals out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491350/extras/72669b81a0739705676019d3bf059969.avif?t=1765121104\" width=1024 height=308 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oversee the seeker base to retrieve powerful artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist the locals with their requests to uncover the secrets of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip seekers with powerful abilities and summonable monsters to survive the ruthless battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High risk, high reward. A smart move brings great gains, but a foolish choice? Say goodbye to all your loot!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Seeker Tactics is a turn-based extraction looter. Players assume the role of a Seeker, exploring dangerous dungeons, seeking powerful artifacts, and ensuring their safe escape.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491350/761fb5240ddc874d04a4b3e5424e981cf420f0f5/header.jpg?t=1765121104", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491350/e6afbb8bf20d1ab65588b42971370c9bdefdd89a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765121104", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491350/e6afbb8bf20d1ab65588b42971370c9bdefdd89a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765121104", "website": "https://da2creative.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 1800 or Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060TI, RX480</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["DA2 Creative Inc."], "pu